  **Acceptance criteria:**
  - One weekly email lists every item returned by the read-only reorder-point query.
  **Executor:** GitHub Actions
  **Diagram:**
  ```flowchart
  flowchart TB
    P["GitHub Actions"] -->|Configure weekly schedule| T1["Scheduled workflow"]
    P -->|Query reorder-point stock| T2["Northwind Order Service"]
    P -->|Send restock email| T3["Store mail service"]
  ```
  **Tasks:**
